Z||000000||Fiero*101||09-09-2001||02:23 AM||||Im not sure why but my battery is losing power it will be fine then when i shut it off and not start it again for a few hours the stupid thing is dead<BR>and its a NEW battery<P>any ideas  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Fiero*101||||reg||1
Z||000001||LarryB||09-09-2001||03:17 AM||||<BR>First thing to try is to charge up the battery then disconnect the - terminal from the car and let it sit overnight, then connect it up in the morning and see if the car starts.  If it does you know it's not the battery, so you can either get busy with a schematic and a voltmeter or try pulling fuses.  If it's not the battery it could be something isn't shutting off that should be (do you have a factory subwoofer/amp?) or you're having trouble with one of the components of your alternator.||||reg||1
